--
N5008 [expr.reinterpret.cast]/1, [expr.const.cast]/1: casts of an array
operand apply the array-to-pointer conversion; the libstdc++ node storage
idiom (`reinterpret_cast<T *>(storage)') depends on it.
The expected sizes and offsets are those of the LP64 x86_64 data model
(`--64'); the test is not meaningful in a 32-bit configuration.
